E","PRIMARY_DIAGNOSTIC_NOT_RETRIABLE","HARD_BLOCKED_OUTCOME","EXPERIMENT_TERMINAL","AVAILABILITY_OBSERVATION_NOT_FRESH"],"title":"RetryDenialReason","type":"string"},"RetryPolicy":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Specification section 11.3: the immutable bounded automatic-retry policy.\n\n``maximum_attempts_per_slot`` counts the initial attempt and every successor\nalready created for the slot, so the value ``1`` always disables automatic\nretry (specification 11.5). The fresh-availability requirement for an\n``UNAVAILABLE`` predecessor is fixed ``true`` in Project 1.","properties":{"automatically_retry_terminal_states":{"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/RetryTerminalState"},"maxItems":3,"title":"Automatically Retry Terminal States","type":"array","uniqueItems":true},"maximum_attempts_per_slot":{"maximum":5,"minimum":1,"title":"Maximum Attempts Per Slot","type":"integer"},"require_fresh_availability_observation_for_unavailable":{"const":true,"title":"Require Fresh Availability Observation For Unavailable","type":"boolean"},"retry_delay_seconds":{"maximum":300,"minimum":0,"title":"Retry Delay Seconds","type":"integer"},"schema_version":{"const":"1.0.0","title":"Schema Version","type":"string"}},"required":["schema_version","maximum_attempts_per_slot","automatically_retry_terminal_states","retry_delay_seconds","require_fresh_availability_observation_for_unavailable"],"title":"RetryPolicy","type":"object"},"RetryTerminalState":{"enum":["FAILED","TIMED_OUT","UNAVAILABLE"],"title":"RetryTerminalState","type":"string"},"RunId":{"pattern":"^run_[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-4[0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}(?![\\s\\S])","type":"string"},"Sha256":{"pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}(?![\\s\\S])","type":"string"}},"$id":"urn:crypto-lab:schema:experiments:retry-decision-record:1.0.0","$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"description":"Plan section 3.9: the complete, immutable outcome of one retry evaluation.\n\nThe sixteen fields in order. Identity is ``(logical_slot_id,\npredecessor_run_id)``; there is no revision and no separate operational\nidentifier, and the created successor is found through run identity and\npredecessor relationships, never through a field of this record. Field 16,\n``decided_at_utc``, is clock metadata and the sole exclusion from the semantic\nprojection. See the module docstring for the outcome-governed presence rules\nand the declared consistency filter.","properties":{"availability_observation_id":{"$ref":"#/$defs/AvailabilityObservationId","title":"Availability Observation Id"},"created_attempt_count":{"maximum":5,"minimum":1,"title":"Created Attempt Count","type":"integer"},"decided_at_utc":{"$ref":"#/$defs/CalendarValidUtcDateTime"},"denial_reason":{"$ref":"#/$defs/RetryDenialReason","title":"Denial Reason"},"experiment_id":{"$ref":"#/$defs/ExperimentId"},"experiment_spec_hash":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Sha256"},"hard_block_error_code":{"$ref":"#/$defs/ErrorCode","title":"Hard Block Error Code"},"logical_slot_id":{"$ref":"#/$defs/LogicalSlotId"},"outcome":{"$ref":"#/$defs/RetryDecisionOutcome"},"predecessor_run_id":{"$ref":"#/$defs/RunId"},"predecessor_terminal_state":{"$ref":"#/$defs/EngineRunState"},"primary_terminal_diagnostic_id":{"$ref":"#/$defs/DiagnosticId"},"reserved_successor_attempt_number":{"$ref":"#/$defs/ReservedAttemptNumber","title":"Reserved Successor Attempt Number"},"retry_not_before_utc":{"$ref":"#/$defs/CalendarValidUtcDateTime","title":"Retry Not Before Utc"},"retry_policy":{"$ref":"#/$defs/RetryPolicy"},"schema_version":{"const":"1.0.0","title":"Schema Version","type":"string"}},"required":["schema_version","experiment_id","logical_slot_id","predecessor_run_id","experiment_spec_hash","retry_policy","created_attempt_count","predecessor_terminal_state","primary_terminal_diagnostic_id","outcome","decided_at_utc"],"title":"RetryDecisionRecord","type":"object"}
